---
title: How to publish a document to the web
sidebar:
  order: 10
---
**To publish a document to the web:**

1. **Navigate to Documents: From the sidebar, select the “Documents” section (as shown in step 1).**

1. **Select a Document: Click on the document you wish to publish (step 3).**

1. **Click the Share Icon: On the document’s page, locate the share icon (step 1 on the second image).**

1. **Publish to Web: Click the “Publish to Web” button to generate a link.**

1. **Copy or Share the Link: A link will be generated, which you can copy and share. Anyone with this link will be able to access the document.**

**Click “Unpublish” to revoke access to the document if needed.**
